{{#> base title="You are invited"}}
<p>Hello,</p>
<p><strong>{{truncate inviterName}}</strong> invited you to join <strong>{{truncate organizationName}}</strong> on REDOVA as <strong>{{roleLabel}}</strong>.</p>
{{> button url=acceptUrl label="View invitation"}}
<p>This invitation expires on {{formatDate expiresAt}}. Sign in (or create an account) with this email address to accept it.</p>
<p>If you did not expect this invitation, you can ignore this email.</p>
{{/base}}
